message: >-
  If you use Crucible in research or engineering work, please cite the repository and the exact
  release or commit used.
title: Crucible
type: software
authors:
  - name: Corvidae Coding Projects
abstract: >-
  A universal software bug-finding, triage, repair, and verification harness designed around
  reproducible evidence, minimized counterexamples, executable invariants, and adversarial patch
  verification.
repository-code: https://github.com/Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crucible
url: https://github.com/Corvidae-Coding-Projects/crucible
license: MIT
version: 0.0.0-design
keywords:
  - software testing
  - fuzzing
  - formal verification
  - Verus
  - property-based testing
  - symbolic execution
  - concurrency testing
  - program repair
